UID:dZPoc4y5cC
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 90 mins (1h30m)\n\nShe only has two desires\, and on
 e of them is justice. Honey O’Donahue\, a small-town private investigato
 r\, delves into a series of strange deaths tied to a mysterious church in 
 this comic noir.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/honey-dont
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 3\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
